OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murdering partner after
OL,4,Abroken glass bottle attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering his
OL,7,F23-year-old partner at her flat in the
OL,8,Fnorth of Glasgow.
OL,10,FAlexander, 54, is on trial at the High
OL,11,FCourt in Glasgow accused of killing
OL,12,FBrodie MacGregor in August 2024.
OL,14,FProsecutors claim Brennan punched and
OL,15,Fslapped MacGregor, and repeatedly
OL,16,Fstruck her with glass bottles - some of
OL,17,Fwhich were broken.
OL,19,FHe is also accused of hitting her with
OL,20,Fa microwave plate and inflicting blunt
OL,21,Fforce trauma injuries by means unknown.
